    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "使用阿克曼公式计算增益矩阵 K 需要用到 P_c^{-1}。完全能控性是必不可少的，因为只有系统完全能控，才能保证能控性矩阵 P_c 满秩，从而保证 P_c^{-1} 存在。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "Computing the gain matrix K using Ackermann's formula requires the use of P_c^{-1}. Complete controllability is essential because only then can we guarantee that the controllability matrix P_c has full rank and hence that P_c^{-1} exists.",
